# Replace the rooms of the map in use: /rooms/set, served by the rooms node. They are saved with the
# map and published on /rooms. Refused, with the reason, when map_name is not the map in use, a
# name is missing, too long (over 40) or repeated, or an outline has fewer than 3 corners.
string map_name
Room[] rooms      # the complete new list; empty deletes them all
---
bool success
string message
